    "detailed_description": "WARNING: This is a very hard game. Please try the demo first. Please do not continue if you can't handle it<br><br><i>As Trance wakes up from slumber, she figures out what is happening. She meets old friends who, to her confusion, are now her enemies. One, by one, she fights them. </i><br><br>The game is a <strong>SHORT</strong> and <strong>SIMPLE</strong> 2D side-scrolling adventure platformer featuring an unlikely pixel graphic style in different worlds. Challenge and test your abilities with the game\u2019s extreme difficulty. Overcome level obstacles. Solve puzzles. Defeat Trance' enemies. Win her battle. And acquire Trance' skills.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Fight Enemies</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1795780/extras/44eb5ad7c81538861b462c9709df304f.poster.avif?t=1642687535\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1795780/extras/44eb5ad7c81538861b462c9709df304f.webm?t=1642687535\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1795780/extras/44eb5ad7c81538861b462c9709df304f.mp4?t=1642687535\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Overcome Obstacles</h2><br>This maybe the hardest part of the game. Be ready to repeat!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1795780/extras/bf8ec5c75978b12cb86a4f45818b4b94.poster.avif?t=1642687535\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1795780/extras/bf8ec5c75978b12cb86a4f45818b4b94.webm?t=1642687535\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1795780/extras/bf8ec5c75978b12cb86a4f45818b4b94.mp4?t=1642687535\" type=\"video/mp4\